  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6201.07 “Emergency service personnel” means “fire service personnel” as defined in RSA 21-P:25, II (c). The term includes “emergency medical care provider” as defined in RSA 153-A:2, V.\n\nSource. #7552, INTERIM, eff 9-5-01, EXPIRED: 3-4-02\n\nNew. #7747, eff 8-17-02; ss by #9496, eff 6-26-09; ss by #12477, eff 2-8-18",
